::scene TITLE

EVENT FADE_IN

TITLE neighbors_14b_logo

MUSIC neighbors_theme
♪ The Neighbors from 14B theme begins playing. ♪
MUSIC_END

TICKER
CITY TRANSIT ANNOUNCES MINOR DELAYS DUE TO AUTOMATED TANK COLLISION • BUY ACID COLA™ • APARTMENT LOTTERY RESULTS AVAILABLE AFTER MIDNIGHT •
TICKER_END

EVENT DISSOLVE

::scene OPENING

ROOM studio_stage

CAM 1 WIDE

SHOT
The broadcast opens on a cramped apartment living room. The furniture is mismatched, a ceiling pipe drips steadily into a saucepan, and an ancient television hums softly in the corner.
SHOT_END

NPC npc_frank
NPC npc_donna

EVENT APPLAUSE

FRANK:
Donna!

DONNA:
What?

FRANK:
The pipe's making that noise again.

DONNA:
Which one?

FRANK:
The loud one.

DONNA:
Frank...

DONNA:
They're all loud.

EVENT LAUGHTER

::scene MAINTENANCE

CAM 2 TRACK frank

SHOT
The camera follows Frank into the tiny kitchen where six different pipes rattle through the walls.
SHOT_END

FRANK:
I called maintenance.

DONNA:
Good.

FRANK:
They put me on hold.

DONNA:
How long?

FRANK:
Yesterday.

EVENT LAUGHTER

ENTER maintenance_bot

CAM 3 MEDIUM maintenance_bot

SHOT
A battered maintenance robot rolls into the apartment, trailing sparks and carrying a wrench larger than one of its arms.
SHOT_END

BOT:
Maintenance request acknowledged.

BOT:
Estimated repair time...

BOT:
Three to five business months.

EVENT LAUGHTER

FRANK:
Can you at least stop the leak?

BOT:
Leak subscription expired.

EVENT APPLAUSE
EVENT LAUGHTER

::scene THE FIX

CAM 4 CLOSEUP maintenance_bot

ACTION maintenance_bot tightens a single valve.

SHOT
The robot tightens a single valve.

Every pipe in the apartment immediately becomes twice as loud.
SHOT_END

FRANK:
...

DONNA:
Well...

DONNA:
It's louder.

BOT:
Repair successful.

EVENT LAUGHTER

::scene TAG

CAM 1 WIDE

SHOT
The couple sits on the couch, shouting over the deafening roar of vibrating plumbing.

Water suddenly begins pouring from a ceiling light fixture into Frank's coffee.
SHOT_END

FRANK:
Think it'll stop?

DONNA:
Eventually.

FRANK:
When?

DONNA:
When the ceiling falls down.

EVENT LAUGHTER

ACTION npc_frank watches as the ceiling light flickers violently.

ACTION npc_frank stares as a ceiling tile drops into his lap.

FRANK:
...

FRANK:
Called it.

EVENT APPLAUSE
EVENT LAUGHTER

::scene CREDITS

CAM 2 WIDE

SHOT
The camera slowly pulls back from Apartment 14B as the familiar theme plays over the closing credits. The sounds of rattling pipes continue long after the apartment disappears from view.
SHOT_END

MUSIC neighbors_theme
♪ The Neighbors from 14B theme begins playing. ♪
MUSIC_END

EVENT FADE_OUT

END